<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Trading light.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Trading light.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stock trading was light after hours Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's more or less a quiet day,&quot; one after-hours trader said.</p>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp, which fell 8-1/8 points to 19-7/8 during regular trading, was inactive after the bell, traders said. Earlier the company said it expected to report first quarter net income below analysts's expectations.</p>
